{"file": "n8n-flows-real-v4/mf-sub-crm-mail.json", "row": 4, "cells": ["Creates or updates the HubSpot contact keyed on the lead's e-mail, with custom properties hadavin_lead_id and hadavin_label", "LabelOk output 0 (label hot, warm or cold and not unknown_model)", "email, lead_key, label from SubIn and Qualify", "success output 0 to SetCrmId; error output 1 to OutStage; the item carries the node answer (vid)", "retryOnFail 2 tries, 1000 ms; then onError=continueErrorOutput to OutStage (outcome stage_failed). Node has no timeout setting, so a slow HubSpot is bounded only by the lease (README real)", "HubSpot side: e-mail (upsert) so a retry does not make a second contact; two lead ids with one e-mail become one contact (README real, UNVERIFIED against live HubSpot)", "HubSpot contact (external); no local write", "credential hubspotAppToken name hubspot-app-token; id changes from HUBSPOT_CREDENTIAL_ID (v4) to HS_CRED_PLACEHOLDER (v5, diff CHANGED CrmUpsert.credentials)", "runs as the n8n instance owner with the named credential; no per-flow identity (UNVERIFIED: runtime account)", "n8n execution log (not saved); HubSpot activity (UNVERIFIED)", "nothing directly; the contact appears in HubSpot (UNVERIFIED: never run)", "ends after 2 tries", "L2b1-4"]}
{"file": "n8n-flows-real-v4/mf-sub-crm-mail.json", "row": 5, "cells": ["Stores the CRM id in mf_leads.crm_id. v4 stores String($json.vid); if the node answers with id and no vid the column holds the text 'undefined'; v5 stores $json.id ?? $json.vid ?? '' and checks it (CHANGED SetCrmId.parameters)", "CrmUpsert output 0", "lead_key, claim_token from SubIn; vid from CrmUpsert", "row (lead_key) to OwnsClaim1 in v4; to CrmIdOk in v5 (diff: REMOVED edge SetCrmId->OwnsClaim1, ADDED edge SetCrmId->CrmIdOk)", "no onError: a database error stops the sub-workflow run here (UNVERIFIED: what the caller then does; recovery re-runs it after the lease)", "lead_key + claim_token + state=processing; same value written twice is harmless", "mf_leads (Postgres): crm_id, updated_at", "postgres credential name n8n-publish-pg (id placeholder PG_CREDENTIAL_ID)", "runs as the n8n instance owner with the named credential; no per-flow identity (UNVERIFIED: runtime account)", "n8n execution log (not saved)", "a wrong crm_id (text undefined) is not visible to anyone; later checks that crm_id IS NOT NULL pass wrongly", "single statement", "L2b1-4"]}
